WEBVTT

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:15.470
Through mountain paths buried in deep
snow and riddled with wandering beasts...

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.840
he walked until he finally found the town.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:23.080
He hurried to the town, overcome with impatience.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:30.080
Right then, he ran into a girl sitting in the
middle of an open field in front of him.

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:34.800
On top of grass that sparkled with dew,

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:39.630
her body was adorned with glowing feathers.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:42.760
She smiled at the boy; the most
peaceful smile he had ever seen.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.100
...We meet again.

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:58.120
...Here. Thank you.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.490
Ayane.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.540
Isn't that what was on your mind?

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:15.660
The desire to know my name?

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:41.930
Oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:47.700
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:51.410
umetsukusu jouhou
Immersing information

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:55.810
ikigurushii kono joukyou
This suffocating situation

00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:59.980
jibun ga inai
I'm not here

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:03.020
kono sekai no bousou
The world is going out of control

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:07.320
tada musekinin ni toubou
Run away irresponsibly

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:10.360
dokoe ikuno
Where am I going?

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:13.260
Huriyamanu ameni
The never-ending rain

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:16.870
zubunure oitekareta kokoro ga
Soak the neglected heart

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:21.840
kuzure yuku chokuzen no koe wo kike
Listen to the voices before it collapses

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:27.540
sasayakana kizunade ii
I'm fine with the subtle connection

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:33.580
sotto anata wo dakishimeru kara
I will hold you gently

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:45.030
kasaneta inochi ga
yukkurito ima kokyuu shite iru
The overlapped souls breathe slowly

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:48.830
sobani iruyo
"I'll be by your side."

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:54.670
Oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:02:54.670 --> 00:03:00.440
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:10.490
So the authors of that picture
book were Kanzato-kun's...

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:14.290
Yeah, my dad wrote the story
and my mom drew the pictures.

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:20.400
No wonder. I noticed you had
the same name, but it's true.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.660
You've read it before?

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:25.970
Uh-huh. I'm sure it's still at my parents' house.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:29.030
I used to like that book when I was little.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:31.460
Really? Thanks.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:36.280
What kind of story is A Whale's Feather?

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:43.340
Well, a boy goes on a journey to find
a way to make everyone happy, but...

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.080
He couldn't find it anywhere.

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:51.690
Huh? Is that wrong?
Was it supposed to mean happiness?

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.420
No, I mean...

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:04.340
Basically, it's kind of a mystery.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:07.270
But it really sticks to your mind, or I mean...

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.940
Yeah, something like that.

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:11.580
See?

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.010
Would they have it at our academy library?

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:16.680
If you want, you can borrow mine.

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:18.320
Thank you.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:20.610
Welcome back, Jun-kun.

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:32.660
Jun! A Whale's Feather...

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.400
What?

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:38.810
You took it somewhere, right? Can I borrow it?

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:40.770
Morimoto wants to read it.

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:43.630
I don't have it.

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:46.210
It's gone.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.810
Well, hey...

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:16.570
We barely made it,
but most of the pills were fake.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.980
And I can't get a hold of that man.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.440
The medical staff members are gone.

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:26.610
Our bank account has been frozen.

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:29.750
All supporters must have
withdrawn from the project.

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:32.560
It can't be helped.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:36.220
If Kujo-san doesn't wake up, we're all gonna...

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:51.010
This is mine.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:54.580
That's not the point. It's meaningless.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:55.550
You know it, too.

00:05:56.150 --> 00:06:02.710
He died before, but just then, he let his
Persona take his body so he could keep living.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.650
It's like making a deal with the devil.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:12.530
It's fine. I know.

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:17.510
In the name of temporary relief, we may
have to purge some apathetic psyches.

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:21.670
Something's needed to complete our Personas.

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:27.710
Bring the boy to me.

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:30.340
While our supplies last.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:41.200
"The Star of Naginomori Academy:
Morimoto Kanaru!" is perfect.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:43.860
Would "The Star of Toyama" be too much?

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:47.270
We'd be able to use it when she goes to nationals.

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:50.760
Nationals? Please, I couldn't...

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:00.580
Yuki...

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:03.110
Where are you?

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:17.950
Hey.

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:19.900
Hey...

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:25.410
What are you standing there for?
Your shift already started.

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.100
Oh, right.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.640
Are you off already?

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:33.550
Yeah. I'm gonna go help make the bammer.

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:35.640
...The banner?

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:39.480
Oh... You know, for tomorrow. Morimoto's thing.

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:42.320
Right... The Speech Contest.

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:45.130
She's been working hard for it.

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:48.630
You should come, too. She would appreciate it.

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:51.500
It's in English, right? I wouldn't understand it.

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:54.630
Yeah, right. You have good grades.

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:57.240
I mean, that's besides the point.

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.610
If her friends are there, you know...

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:02.080
You should tell me what her speech was like later.

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:03.670
S-sure.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:07.080
Wait, what makes you think I'd understand it?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.990
You've changed, recently.

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:19.960
See you.

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:24.460
Ayanagi City Civic Hall at 3pm!

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:25.890
Come if you can!

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:33.470
Friends, huh?

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:51.650
Huh?

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:13.440
The second one.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:17.440
Aren't you... taking the train?

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:25.580
Nevermind... Let's walk.

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:49.040
Where do you live?

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:51.610
Very close to you.

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:53.140
Since when?

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:56.840
I wanted you to notice me for a long, long time.

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:04.690
I... think I might have known.

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:14.130
I was a doll loved wrong.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:16.160
So I sank.

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.900
Higher and higher...

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:25.540
I became a part of something that lay
quietly, and then I became the whole.

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:28.770
But... I was alone.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:38.010
I always felt like people expected
me to act a certain way.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.250
I love my brother and Yuki, but I...

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:44.460
I've always wanted to be alone.

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:52.070
With you, I won't be alone.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:55.870
With you, I can be alone.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:08.640
He's late.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:13.690
He's way late! How did I get back before him?

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:16.660
He answered your call, right? Then...

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:19.100
That's not the problem here.

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:25.940
Come on, Jun's already in 9th grade.
What's wrong with having a girlfriend?

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:28.810
No way! Is this true?

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.170
Jun-kun's this!?

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.650
Which generation are you from?

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:36.650
She really caught my attention.

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.280
The girl Jun was with.

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:41.650
I feel like I've seen her before.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.030
I'm back.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:53.200
Hey.

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:58.260
The Star of Toyama?

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:00.470
Morimoto's contest.

00:13:00.470 --> 00:13:01.770
You're coming too, right?

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:04.570
I can't tomorrow.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:09.280
Tell her I said good luck.

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:12.850
A date?

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:36.140
Jun! Hey, Jun!

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:38.980
He just left a second ago.

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:39.780
Where!?

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.780
I-I'm sure you can catch him if you run...

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:43.550
Thanks!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:47.810
You're welcome.

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.600
Next person, please.

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:29.660
What am I doing?

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:48.940
Next person, please.

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:01.260
Who are you?

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.120
What did you do to Jun?

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:08.330
Say something!

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:13.160
Are you okay?

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:26.810
Did you know? Before the tsunami comes,
the sea grows unbelievably calm.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:31.260
The tide lowers in this respite.

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:37.830
The pain...

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:39.990
Eiko-neechan?

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:46.170
If it's your wish to know...

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:29.480
Ryo!?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:33.680
Eiko-neechan?

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:41.860
The sin that fights back destiny.

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:47.960
Ryo... Ryo!

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:56.900
Eiko-neechan...

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:02.180
The destiny that fights back sin.

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:06.580
Ryo!

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:08.990
Choosing is...

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:18.150
Discarding.

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:36.540
Niichan?

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:48.620
That day... The first mistake was...

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:30.560
Niichan.

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:44.650
Why?

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:01.300
Your wish will be...

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:30.290
Hey, sto-

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:33.000
Aniki?

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:51.980
11th Annual High School Speech Contest

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.390
Nope. It's his voice mail.

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:58.090
Shin's flaking.

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:01.630
He might already be inside.

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:03.720
Isn't it starting soon?

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:06.100
Kanaru?

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:08.140
Huh? Oh...

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:11.200
Relax! You'll be fine!

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:12.100
Yes.

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.140
Hey.

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:16.440
Mayu!

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.600
Mayuri-san.

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:19.980
Hey, so you came.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:22.850
There might not be a next time, so...

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:26.410
Hey, Morimoto could win, though.

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:27.990
You're right.

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:42.860
Would I be asking too much if I
still felt lonely, Kanzato-kun?

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:50.610
Number 12, Naginomori Academy High
School senior, Morimoto Kanaru-san.

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:09.620
Oniichan...

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.060
Oniichan!

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:18.300
What are you doing?

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:25.110
You're gonna catch a cold.

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:55.280
Itsukara yume miru koto
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:21:55.280 --> 00:22:01.420
Wasureta huri wo shitetan darou
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:01.650
Chiisana mado akeru yuuki mo naku
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:22:01.650 --> 00:22:07.890
Chiisana mado akeru yuuki mo naku
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle.

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:12.990
Kiseki wo matteta
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle.

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:13.160
Kiseki wo matteta
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:13.160 --> 00:22:23.240
ushinau mono nado nakatta anohi no yona
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:23.240 --> 00:22:28.310
mujakisa wa mou naikedo
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:28.310 --> 00:22:28.680
namida wo nugutta ato niwa
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:34.820
namida wo nugutta ato niwa
After wiping away the tears

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:40.750
atarashii jibun ni deaeru
I'll be able to meet a new self

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:44.660
subete wo nakushitemo
mitsuke rareru monoga arukara
Even if I lose everything

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:50.930
subete wo nakushitemo
mitsuke rareru monoga arukara
There are still some things to discover

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:56.700
kesenai kizumo itsuka
Even the scars that remain

00:22:56.700 --> 00:22:56.740
watashi rashii hokori ni dekiru
Even the scars that remain

00:22:56.740 --> 00:23:04.010
watashi rashii hokori ni dekiru
will someday become my pride

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:10.820
If I can see you again,

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:14.050
I have so many things I want to say.

00:23:14.050 --> 00:23:18.390
Your voice, appearance,
and personality are different.

00:23:18.390 --> 00:23:22.400
But your gazing and smile are still yours.

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:27.030
This memory belongs to just you and me.

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:29.340
Twisting in the Sea of Psyche.

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:31.970
A dancing, peeled white feather.

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:36.670
A temporary miracle inside the distortion.
